From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:50:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 072/111] Open <details> stay open when a block is added above

The preview kept which <details> were opened by their position in the
document, so adding a <details> above an open one moved the open state
to the wrong one. They are now kept by their summary text (white space
collapsed, images by alt text), with a count for repeated summaries, so
the state stays with its <details> across edits above it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

